e":["gerrit_to_platform.ini.template:24-29 'g2p dispatches via GitHub workflow_dispatch(ref = refs/heads/{GERRIT_BRANCH})… workflow_dispatch REQUIRES that ref to EXIST on the GitHub mirror… without it a feature change 422s -> no Verified'","replication.config:57-78 replicates only refs/heads/main, refs/changes/*, refs/heads/feature/* — gerrit-e2e-test is NOT covered","reviewbot-e2e.sh:35-50 header frames the TEMPORARY test-branch refspec as a prerequisite for the POST-MERGE 'GitHub-appearance poll', not for pre-review CI dispatch","ABSENCE: the plan adds a Verified-vote wait but says nothing about ensuring the test branch is replicated/exists on the mirror before review"],"finding":"The plan requires waiting for a Verified +1 on a change targeting the gerrit-e2e-test branch, but does not surface the prerequisite that CI (gerrit-to-platform) will only cast Verified if refs/heads/gerrit-e2e-test EXISTS on the GitHub mirror at review time — and the current replication.config replicates only main, refs/changes/*, and feature/*.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f2fd5b4c67b6deb2e","impact":1.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach + AC line 'The E2E fails unless both LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1 are present'","norm_id":"n86dd0f293af3f014","priority":0.6,"reason":"high-priority+criterion-opted-in","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Operator runs the updated E2E with only the post-merge refspec (or none): the change gets LLM-Review +1 but the CI workflow_dispatch 422s because gerrit-e2e-test is absent on the mirror, so Verified never arrives and the new both-votes poll times out into HARNESS-FAILURE on every run"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"In the Approach, note that the Verified vote depends on refs/heads/${TEST_BRANCH} existing on the mirror at dispatch time (per gerrit_to_platform.ini.template / replication.config); reuse the header's temporary-refspec prerequisite for BOTH pre-review CI dispatch and the post-merge poll, and add a pre-flight check that ls