r bot, or the script casts it via the Gerrit REST API) so the wait for it is satisfiable.","cohort":["COH","E1","E2","E6","F1","T2","T4","T5b","T5e"],"criteria":["E2","E6"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.49,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["'wait for both active gate votes before testing submit'","AC: 'The E2E fails unless both LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1 are present on the tested patchset.'","ABSENCE: no source/provenance stated for the Verified vote in the E2E flow"],"finding":"The plan requires waiting for a `Verified +1` vote but does not state what produces that vote during the E2E run (a CI/verifier bot, a manual reviewer, or the script itself), so an executor cannot know whether the wait can ever be satisfied.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f6c7f9abebff4a156","impact":0.44,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach / AC line 2 ('The E2E fails unless both LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1 are present')","norm_id":"nbc83872754a1b6c6","priority":0.11,"reason":"low-validity","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Executor writes a wait loop that blocks forever because nothing casts Verified +1 in the test environment"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.25,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"no","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"underspecified_oracle","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","